  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upphandling av IPM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">upphandling av IPM - IPM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En konsult upphandlades genom avrop f&#xf6;r att ge metodst&#xf6;d till Sida - ffr allt i f&#xe4;lt. Catharina Schmitz fr&#xe5;n IPM-Indevelop upphandlades 2008. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r &#xf6;ka bidrag och st&#xf6;d i bist&#xe5;ndet i f&#xe4;lt f&#xf6;r kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt enligt budget propositionen f&#xf6;r 2008.Konsulten ska ge metodst&#xf6;d i f&#xe4;lt; identifiera relevanta policy omr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r WEE f&#xf6;r Sida att fokusera p&#xe5; och ta fram en handlingsplan f&#xf6;r WEE &#xe5;t Sid</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Budget Bill for 2008 states that as a thematic priority Sida shall work especially on gender mainstreaming in support of women&apos;s economic empowerment. The Secretariat for gender equality at Sida therefore prioritizes cooperation with INEC to implement this thematic priority in accordance with the Terms of Reference of February 22.A consultant was hired to provide methodological support.</narrative>
  </description>
